      "snippet": {
        "line": 295,
        "text": "∃ L : Space → FormalMultilinearSeries ℝ SpaceTime V, (∀ n, L 0 n = 0) ∧ (∀ n x, Tendsto (iteratedFDeriv ℝ n f) (𝓝[openPast 1] (1, x)) (𝓝 (L x n))) ∧ (∀ n, TendstoLocallyUniformly (fun t x => iteratedFDeriv ℝ n f (t, x)) (fun x => L x n) (𝓝[<] 1))"
      }
